description = "Laserdisc arcade emulator built on Hypseus Singe (a Daphne fork), 64-bit with audio, GPU rendering (Vulkan or OpenGL) and hardware video decoding on Android. Plays daphne.exe data: launch roms/<game>.zip or framefile/<game>.txt. Also plays Singe 1 and Singe 2 games (Singe 2 MP4 video as it is) through the RocketLauncher batch file beside framefile/. No BIOS needed."
